": "1649951459463035", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623443_1649951462796368_6495437171366118499_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5RzQmbLcmBUQ7kNvwGqVoXG&_nc_oc=AdpR8SMgRe2zdBsuGRyjLFsjKaEQOOyyWOLMUIvctFwnUWWgmvy0OjF1W8PhE_xQnd8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQsn62_5pvvlJWIZuQhipGPuzXl_kFALydQeZZMPQYsMA&oe=6AFC8EC8"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot3.png", "id": "796010373336947", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_796010376670280_1622690528672245878_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jq7AWXo4BisQ7kNvwEF5U6e&_nc_oc=AdosPmjrhsb5EOoxr3boku9IFEaKJs6eyeELSzDYn0SlY_HImyfFMtWZql_Ia0H98aU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRkHhK0CvGqVGvCI5xpyKVljJTL_kV0ElOWjQ7AWHBM8w&oe=6AFC89C8"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot4.png", "id": "900207153052082", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_900207156385415_3810073691747307333_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hd65DL5BGoUQ7kNvwF3abss&_nc_oc=AdpxD5d8yDZ3_-eHEnQRE8qf7vDPtVNXz-B9A3R2fop-8ri6OdMHNFfd9wJX2zHOQQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTx_na21_fGbHVlfP0HqpXzc-5N7hkwXFH9pBpA0nZ8pg&oe=6AFC68EF"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot5.png", "id": "947398901258988", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622214_947398904592321_4765479034696321724_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p7RjveBYIS8Q7kNvwFmt58p&_nc_oc=AdoNopRS4L0mFHFsWXPfoZot51dISlhBh2tyUWV6foLYjvUhW2NJ7GqeZzEowP38TAY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQFAnboeV-YvP27Of50ZvwzDcvuGFLTzfHp6g5gaskpUQ&oe=6AFC89BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Snapshot_1.PNG", "id": "712382138600986", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_712382141934319_6039130477330376030_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2F6XOps-RrgQ7kNvwEzNyn7&_nc_oc=AdqTlJGDWL6EKHeiVuOUTbqHSDaedYDG29KHJR3EI0NIxWhdBBh76p3mZiYc6JRTw6w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSxZ75oMslFq6xxmIwVEHw0X_gHdWKn7XATQKK-x0tadA&oe=6AFC8905"}, "display_name": "The Abstract Art Gallery", "keywords": ["Abstract", "Art", "Gallery", "Neon", "Paintings"], "long_description": "The Abstract Art Gallery is a VR Experience that shows 60 paintings of the famous painter Wassily Kandinsky  (1866 \u2013 1944). He was one of the most important 20th-century artists. He was a major figure in modern art and painted some of the first modern abstract works.\n\nThe experience does not show the original paintings of Wassily Kandinsky, instead it presents a Neon-Futuristic version of each painting. You have a play button on each panting to see an AI Animation made with the Meta AI.\n\nThe exposition is divided in 6 sections (each section contains 10 paintings), and there is a transportation point to move from one section to another.\n\nKandinsky also developed a theory of geometric figures and their relationships, claiming (for example) that the circle is the most peaceful shape and represents the human soul.", "short_description": "The Abstract Art Gallery is a VR Experience that shows 60 paintings of the famous painter Wassily Kandinsky  (1866 \u2013 1944)."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-notice-last-updated-april-15_19.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/who-are-we-indie-virtual-reality-video.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "4349619